#, machine, plain1
msgid "A Circle guild is private for good: only its members see it, and they post straight into it, so what they write does not appear on their own profiles. You invite members free, or set a price in coins to join, and the coins go to you. This can't be changed later."
msgstr "Tá guild Ciorcal príobháideach le haghaidh maith: ach a baill a fheiceáil é, agus tá siad post díreach isteach é, mar sin ní cad a scríobh siad le feiceáil ar a gcuid próifílí féin. Iarrann tú ar bhaill saor in aisce, nó a leagtar ar phraghas i boinn a bheith páirteach, agus na boinn dul a thabhairt duit. Ní féidir é seo a athrú níos déanaí."

#, machine, plain1
